/* ── COMPOSER LEFT-EDGE LOCK (2026-08-03 owner report) ──────────────────
 * The composer used to be centred in the pane (margin:0 auto), ~(band−820)/2
 * RIGHT of the avatar column in every roomy state — the input box "swam"
 * under the conversation, and the rail zone beside it could never host
 * anything. The composer now sits ON the message column: its LEFT edge is
 * the avatar line and its right edge is the text column's right edge, in
 * every pane state.
 *
 * margin-left REPLAYS .chat-inner's own centering math (same max-width
 * formula — including its 48px inset cap when the rail is granted.
 * `min(48px, --rail-w)` resolves to zero with no rail, retaining the old
 * centering/compact-fold geometry) + the same 24px inset, so
 * the two can never drift. The rail grant
