/* Pinned zone removed — replaced by folders */

/* ── New Chat — the one place the sidebar raises its voice ──────────────
   A paper slip with a single filled caramel plus. Everything around it is a
   quiet row, so the CTA takes its emphasis from ONE solid mark rather than a
   bevel + gradient + shadow stack; the previous version read as an empty
   text input sitting above the conversation list. */
