   bottom border (a visible seam). Keep the separators BETWEEN rows in a
   multi-call card (they group the parallel calls) but drop it on the final
   row — the card edge already draws that line. Covers the solo card too
   (its single row is the last row). The descendant `.ptool-line` reaches a
   row nested in a `.ptool-results-block` header as well. */
[data-theme="tofu"] .ptool-turn > [data-prn]:last-child .ptool-line{
